flowchart LR
  A([TESL email received]) --> B[Match mailbox, folder,<br/>sender and subject]
  B --> C{TESL email?}
  C -- No --> Z0([Ignore])
  C -- Yes --> D[Check source message + TESL idempotency key]
  D --> DD{Duplicate?}
  DD -- Yes --> DX[Record duplicate telemetry<br/>retain first approval] --> DZ([Duplicate safely ignored])
  DD -- No --> E[Parse configured aliases]
  E --> ET[Record sanitized intake telemetry]
  ET --> F[Validate TESL details]
  F --> G{Valid?}
  G -- No --> H[Preserve source and alert owner] --> HF[Route failed extraction] --> HC[Owner manual correction queue] --> Z1([Validation failure / correction pending])
  G -- Yes --> I[Resolve approver and delegation]
  I --> J[Create immutable submission]
  J --> AI[Optional advisory AI review<br/>extract / summarize / flag]
  AI --> AIP[Persist assessment<br/>human decision required]
  AIP --> K[Create Teams approval<br/>email disabled]
  K --> L{Decision}
  L -- Approve/Reject --> N[Persist decision and audit]
  L -- Urgent delegate --> M[Record verbal delegation] --> N
  L -- 14-day timeout --> O[Cancel primary and create EDMS approval]
  O --> N
  N --> P[Teams/SharePoint status<br/>owner-only summary]
  P --> Q[Approved desktop boundary<br/>future intranet execution]
  Q --> Z2([Complete])
